        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "68 Garville Lane is a superb newly-built, A-rated, 3 bed & study, semi-detached home offering high-quality contemporary living in a sought-after Rathgar setting. \r\n\r\nExtending to approx. 138 sq. m / 1,485 sq. ft, the property features bright, well-designed accommodation with an open-plan kitchen, dining and living area opening to a private rear garden. A notable feature of the home is the excellent natural light throughout, enhanced by large windows and strategically positioned rooflights, which draw daylight deep into the living spaces and create a bright, airy atmosphere. \r\n\r\nThe accommodation includes three bedrooms, a dedicated study, bathroom, ensuite, guest WC and excellent storage. Finished to a high standard throughout, features include a contemporary McCaul kitchen with quartz worktops, fitted wardrobes, stylish bathrooms, alu-clad windows, underfloor heating at ground floor level, an air-to-water heat pump, EV charging provision and Homebond cover. \r\n\r\nGarville Lane enjoys an excellent position in one of Dublin 6’s most established and desirable residential areas, within easy walking distance of Rathgar Village. Rathgar offers a superb mix of cafés, restaurants, delicatessens, shops, local services and everyday conveniences, while retaining a quiet village atmosphere. Rathmines, Terenure and Ranelagh are also close by, providing further dining, shopping and leisure options. \r\n\r\nThe area is well served by parks, sports clubs, leisure facilities and a strong selection of well-regarded schools, while regular bus routes provide convenient access to the city centre. \r\n\r\nThis is a rare opportunity to acquire a brand-new, energy-efficient home in a mature and highly convenient Dublin location. Contact Lisney Sotheby's International Realty to arrange a viewing appointment."
      },
